  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CodeBreaker.Level2.L2Examine
  displayName: Maintenance Report
  title: MAINTENANCE REPORT
  body: 'Technician on site: R. RAMOS (night shift)

    Responsible for: generator,
    cooling loops, fuse panels, server hall checks every 2 hours.


    Week 41 -
    Cooling loop B leaking again. Patched it. Replacement part (work order #4471)
    still not delivered.

    Week 42 - Generator failed its self-test. Restarted
    it by hand.

    Week 43 - Racks running hot. Told management the shutdown plan
    is not safe while cooling is down. No reply.

    Week 44 - Shutdown confirmed
    for Friday night. I''m told to stay until the last rack is off.'
  image: {fileID: 0}
  verb: Read the Maintenance Report
  flagOnRead: 
