  screen: {fileID: 65739035}
  screenGlow: {fileID: 727164223}
  screenLight: {fileID: 898871523}
  syncingBody: 'Log sync: waiting for the core systems (keycards {n}/3).


    Last
    cached entry - R. Ramos, Friday 22:10:

    "Starting the shutdown checklist.
    Home by morning."'
  finalBody: 'ENTRY 41  -  R. RAMOS  -  timestamp corrupted


    They locked me
    in too...


    The shutdown sealed every door, and nobody came back for me.
    I stopped counting the days.

    If you are reading this, you did what I couldn''t.
    The terminal will ask for the exit code. Get out.


    And if you see me on
    the cameras, don''t stop. Don''t look back. I''m not me anymore.'
  syncingTitle: MAINTENANCE LOG STATION
  finalTitle: MAINTENANCE LOG  -  ENTRY 41
