  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ccc8b208596730143a687c16473d152c, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CodeBreaker.Level2.L2Examine
  displayName: Incident Report
  title: INCIDENT REPORT
  body: 'INCIDENT #0091 - FACILITY SHUTDOWN


    During the planned shutdown the
    cooling system failed and the core started an automatic LOCKDOWN. Every door
    sealed.


    Staff evacuated: 11 of 12.

    Unaccounted for: R. Ramos (maintenance).
    Last seen in the server hall, 23:52.

    Door records show the exit was never
    opened from inside.


    The hall cameras kept recording for 9 days. Flagged
    footage: "a figure standing in the aisles. It does not move between frames."


    Decision:
    site sealed. Search not authorised.'
  image: {fileID: 0}
  verb: Read the Incident Report
  flagOnRead: 
